sequenceDiagram
  participant R as ReservationService
  participant O as Order
  participant I as InventoryService
  participant L as Ledger
  R->>O: lock order
  R->>R: find ACTIVE or CONSUMED
  alt existing
    R-->>R: return existing
  else new
    R->>I: reserve
    I->>I: lock, validate, update
    I->>L: create movement
    R->>R: create reservation item
  end
